      "properties": {},
      "title": "Choose a model or compare both",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image to video\n\n1. Upload your image as the **first frame**.\n2. Edit the prompt to describe motion.\n3. Run **Seedance 2.5** at 720p, 5 seconds.\n4. To compare, select both purple **Seedance 2.0** nodes and press **Ctrl+B**, then run again.\n\nKeep seeds **fixed** and inputs unchanged to reuse the first result. Each enabled model generates a separately billed video. To use only 2.0, bypass both 2.5 nodes first.\n\nOptional: connect a last frame for a first-to-last transition. Both models also offer 1080p. Needs a ModelArk key in Settings > BytePlus."
      ]
    }
